How about a video?

00:06:55.331 --> 00:06:57.250
They can't do that, right?

00:06:57.250 --> 00:07:00.002
Aare we allowed to do that?

00:07:00.002 --> 00:07:02.380
Well, nobody said we can't.

00:07:02.380 --> 00:07:03.005
Okay.

00:07:03.131 --> 00:07:04.632
Video it is. What

00:07:07.885 --> 00:07:08.386
about

00:07:09.387 --> 00:07:09.929
snow?

00:07:09.929 --> 00:07:12.723
Let's do snow.

